Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 17:59:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH v2 0/2] drm/panel: Add support for Novatek NT36532 panel

This series adds support for panels using the Novatek NT36532 Display
Driver IC, a dual-DSI, dual-DSC controller that requires DPU support
for MIPI_DSI_MODE_DSC_ALL_SLICES_IN_PKT.

Signed-off-by: Junjie Cao <caojunjie650@gmail.com>
---
Changes in v2:
- Add Acked-by tag from Conor.
- Rebase onto next-20260723.
- Update drm related APIs, like devm_drm_panel_alloc(), devm_drm_panel_add().
- Drop support for 'slice_per_pkt = 2', as it is supported as MIPI_DSI_MODE_DSC_ALL_SLICES_IN_PKT.
- Link to v1: https://lore.kernel.org/all/20251001135914.13754-2-caojunjie650@gmail.com

Junjie Cao (2):
  dt-bindings: display: panel: Add Novatek NT36532
  drm/panel: Add Novatek NT36532 panel driver

